# Ingestion + RAG

Keep these modules:

- `lib/ingestion/chunker.ts` — 300–500 tokens, prefix each chunk with topic name, split on paragraph/sentence, never mid-word.
- `lib/ingestion/embedder.ts` — embed chunks, write pgvector + metadata; re-embed on topic/chunk edit.
- `lib/rag/retriever.ts` — similarity search + metadata filters (class / subject / topic).

`/api/test/query` — retrieval only (chunks + scores), no LLM.  
`/api/test/chat` — retrieval + prompt builder + Ollama (from M5).

```ts
// ✅
const chunks = await retrieve({ query, classId, subjectId, topicId });

// ❌ skip filters (Class 6 Science must not hit other classes)
const chunks = await retrieve({ query });
```

Do not call Anthropic/OpenAI from the retriever. Cloud LLMs are for dataset generation (M6), not Playground answers.
